  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Joint Devolution Programme (JDP) is a partnership between UNDP, UNICEF, and UN Women with the Government of Kenya to strengthen decentralized service delivery, inclusive governance, and gender equality in line with Kenya&#x2019;s Constitution, Vision 2030, BETA priorities, and the UNSDCF (2022&#x2013;2026). Building on lessons from earlier devolution programmes, the JDP was designed through extensive consultations with national and county governments, oversight institutions, civil society, private sector,</narrative>
  </description>
